window.products.push({"id":387015,"name":"Shazo Airtight 6 Pc Mini Container Set + 6 Spoons, Labels & Marker - Durable Clear Plastic Food Storage Containers with Lids - Kitchen Cabinet Pantry ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91H7c4uGdfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Modular Set - Every air-tight container has been designed to seal in freshness while making access and food prep a breeze. Store your favorite food safely into these efficient containers. With 6 same size containers you won't have to worry about jamming your edibles into smaller containers. Includes (6) Container - 3.25 inch (height) X 3.75 inch (Width) X 3.75 inch (Length) (4.2 cups / 0.5 liters) Ultimate Scoop Cup - Included with your set, 6 Black spoons to match 6 containers. Dry Food Liquid & Friendly - Not only are these good for dry foods, but our containers are great for holding liquids such as water, juice, soup, and more. Container corners allow for easy pouring. Don't worry about spills as the Shazo containers are designed to seal all liquids with airtight technology once the handle has been pushed down Secure Sealing, Stackable Lid Design - Once the ring on the lid is pushed down, the silicone seal inside the lid will expand to seal the jar, creating complete airtightness. Pop the ring back up and it serves as a handle to lift the lid. Provides maximum freshness and prolonged food storage. With a stackable and modular design, these containers will save you a ton of space in your pantry and cabinets for better kitchen organization. Shatterproof. Large Chalkboard Labels - Matte texture with a crisp clean uniform dye cut shape; The surface is not shiny or slippery; strong and durable for an appealing look; These are VINYL stickers - Unlike contact paper, these Premium Chalkboard Labels allows regular chalk or any liquid chalk maker to write on. The ink dries quickly and it doesn't flake off; Dishwasher and refrigerator safe; REUSABLE and self-adhesive. White Marker Included !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91H7c4uGdfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shazo","source_asin":"B099RCGMSV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-387015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099RCGMSV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099RCGMSV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
