window.products.push({"id":387049,"name":"Riverbay Furniture Antique Double Door Curio Cabinet in White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":194.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Mb7FEbU1L._AC_.jpg","description":"The Double Door Cabinet is a stylish and versatile accent piece. Perfect for placing in a living room or bedroom, the cabinet features double doors, interior shelf and a glass front. The antique white finish easily complements a variety of home decor styles. Ample interior space provides storage for a variety of items. Antique bronze hardware completes the look.Features:- Materials: Pine, MDF- Finish: Antique White- Stylish and versatile accent piece- Ample interior storage space- Antique Bronze Hardware- Glass front- Double Door Cabinet- Some Assembly RequiredSpecifications:- Overall Product Dimensions: 38\" H x 36\" W x 15.75\" D- Product Weight: 82 lbs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Mb7FEbU1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riverbay Furniture","source_asin":"B07J5P8BHT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-387049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J5P8BHT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J5P8BHT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":387050,"name":"Twin Air Negative Ion Generator / Ionizer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dH46ASIAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Air ionizer is perfect for smaller rooms and areas that have a lot of electronics. It's a high density corona discharge negative ion generator. Also called ionizer purifiers, this model despite being our weakest ionizer, is still stronger than almost every other air ionizer you can buy. The air is purified by the use of ions. There are no filters to replace, and no additional running costs to worry about. Plug the ionizer in, and enjoy the benefits for many years to come. All units are quality tested prior to shipping to ensure our customers receive only the best products. NB. The ionizer should not be touched while operational. The two towers build up an electrical charge which is part of the function. It is a by-product of the very very high amount of negative ions that are released. **NaturAir Ionizers when first started up will feel significantly stronger than they are meant to, within a few hours they will \"balance\" themselves out to emit the advertised amount of ions. Size 3 inches * 7 inches * 12 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dH46ASIAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NaturAir","source_asin":"B01KT25KU8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-387050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KT25KU8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KT25KU8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":387051,"name":"Oval Beveled Wall Mirror for Home Decor - Vancouver Style - Honey Oak - 15x19 outside dimensions","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VWRUzndNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Gallery Quality Framed Mirror arrives ready to hang with hardware preinstalled for vertical or horizontal hanging. This beautiful real oak frame with a scooping profile was one of the first frames we started making over 3 decades ago and it still remains popular today. The clear Honey Oak finish on this frame allow the natural grain to shine through for a beautiful light oak appearance. This frame is our lightest oak color and conintues to be one of our most popular finishes. This Frame will Ship within 4 business days of your order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VWRUzndNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OvalAndRoundMirrors.com","source_asin":"B0089MQ9P6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-387051","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0089MQ9P6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0089MQ9P6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
