window.products.push({"id":387273,"name":"Calyx Interiors A04HTC350600 Top Down Bottom Up Cordless Cellular Shade, 35\" W x 60\" H, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7196AAfYaFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Calyx Interiors' top-down/bottom-up cellular shades provide a soft look and offer unparalled light control. Perfect for any room where you want to retain your view yet eliminate the glare of the sun, you can lower your shade from the top or raise it from the bottom to place the shade anywhere on your window. This shade features a cordless lift mechanism eliminating long, unsightly cords, and providing a higher element of safety for kids and pets. However, due to the top-down nature of the shade, there are cords that attach the top rail to the shade. Comes with hardware for inside or outside mounting. Note: for inside mount, please order a shade that is smaller than the width of your window so that it fits inside or does not rub against the sides of your window. It should be at least 1/4 of an inch smaller to ensure a proper fit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7196AAfYaFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calyx Interiors","source_asin":"B077TGDNPH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-387273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077TGDNPH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077TGDNPH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":387274,"name":"84Ft 12Pcs Artificial Ivy Leaves, Fake Plants Ivy Leaf Garland with 98FT 300 LED String Lights, Faux Green Hanging Greenery Vines for Room and Wall De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qg05xI7RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Room Decor Set: 12pcs artificial ivy vine and 1 roll 98ft colorful cooper wire fairy lights. Each ivy vine hanging plant is about 7ft long with 80 artificial leaves, total 84ft long. The 98ft hanging string light is USB-powered and long enough to cover all the ivy garlands. The leaf garland and string lights are NOT assembled. Eco-friendly Fake Ive Vines: Our artificial ivy leaves garland is made of silk leaves and plastic stems. Waterproof, durable and not easy to fade. Exquisite dyeing technology makes the fake plants lifelike and vivid in shape and color. The hanging ivy plants with the string lights can be used for room decor and wall decor, wedding, party, etc. USB-Powered String Lights: The color changing 300LEDs 98ft fairy lights is powered by USB, very easy to use, just plug and play. Use the 13-key remote to turn on/off and choose from 8 modes. You can also adjust the brightness and set a timer(6 hours on and 18 hours off per day). Thanks to the low consumption design, it will not overheat even after working a long time, safe to use. Easy Installation: Comes with strong adhesive tape and zip ties, very easy for you to intall the fake vines and string lights. You can use the artificial ivy vine hanging plants together with the string lights, also you can use them seperately according to your own needs. Note: Due to the long-time transportation and storage in Amazon warehouse in sealed bags, it is normal for the artificial ivy leaf garland plants to smell. But do not worry, the ordr is non-toxic and harmless. Please put the faux ivy garlands in a airy palce after receiving them, and the smell will quickly dissipate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qg05xI7RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"agreenworld","source_asin":"B08P3P6FKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-387274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P3P6FKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P3P6FKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
