window.products.push({"id":387444,"name":"O-CONN Smαrt Weighted Hυlα Hoοop for Adults Weight Loss Won’t Fαll, 24 Knots Detachable, Adjustable Length, Abdomen Fitness Equiρment","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710TAPcQ9PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2 in 1 Fitness and Massage Never Fall】Compared with the traditional hula hoop, the upgraded smart weighted hula hoop is easier to use and will never fall, The special design allows the hula hoop to fit snugly around your waist，even the beginners can use it. The 360-degree shock-absorbing massage ring allows you to exercise comfortably and relieve the labor pain in the lower back who have been sitting for a long time. 【24 Knots Detachable Design】Consisting of 24 detachable parts,detachable with a simple push of a button. you can choose your own weighted hula hoop according to your waistline. The weighted hula hoop for exercise can be adjusted to 16 to 24sections according to the waist which fits all sizes and shapes. The sections are easily detached, making it easy to store. The package includes 24 detachable sections. 【Fast fat burning】All-Round Thin 360 Degree Body: the smart weighted hula hoop burns fat three times faster than a normal hoop. exercise 30 minutes per day for 5 days;then you can burn up to 800 calories each time!This weighted hula hoop is you perfect abdomen fitness equipment. 【Quiet Bearings 】360-degree silent rollers can even and flexible rotate, making the smaller noise and smoother rotation.So you can comfortably and quietly use this hula hoop. 【Applicable people and attentions】Almost suitable for all adults and kids but not the elderly or baby. Before exercising, ensure the hoola hoop linking done and wear the close-fitting clothes; When exercising, pay attention to the swing range of the weight ball to avoid touching others or the furnitures. At the same time, it should not be too heavy when it is used for the first time. You can contact us because we are always here or you can check the manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710TAPcQ9PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"O-CONN","source_asin":"B096P96KWL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-387444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096P96KWL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096P96KWL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":387445,"name":"Aililife 3D DIY Wall Clock Decor Sticker Mirror Frameless Large DIY Wall Clock Kit for Home Living Room Bedroom Office Decoration (Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51s4DUeQMaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"3D DIY Wall Clock Modern Frameless Large 3D DIY Wall Clock Kit Decoration for Home Living Room Bedroom Specifications : Material: EVA foam stickers,acrylic,alloy clock face Hour hand: 31cm /12\" Minute hand: 39cm / 15.3\" Clock machine: 12cm/ 4.7\" Time accuracy: -0.8~+1.2second/day Number Size:3.23\" The minimum achieving is: 63cm x 63cm / 24.8\" x 24.8\". Weight:0.47kg.  Power: 1*AA battery (not included) Package Included: 1 x DIY Wall Clock Kit Without Battery How to install: Step1 :Use a hammer to knock the nail into wall,then hang clock tray on the wall   Step2 :Hang the paper scale on the clock tray, according to the scale to mark numbers’ position   Step3 :Remove the paper from back of acrylic mirrors,then fit with matching EVA   Step4 : Remove the back paper of EVA;stick to the wall   Step5 :Tear off the protective films from mirrors   Step6 :Fix the hour hand and minute hand one by one along the 12 o’clock position   Step7 :Tighten the nut   Step8 :Install a carbon AA battery for clock,adjust the time with gear button of quartz   Step9 :Hanging the clock return to wall.Well done!You can enjoy your art-work now Warm Tips: There is a protective film on each surface of mirror.It may looks with scratches.  But the scratches are just on the protective film,the mirrors are still in good condition.  Please tear off after installation! Our Service: If the DIY clock has any problems, you can get a free replacement without a return.  ♥Please feel free to leave us a message if you have any questions. We will reply to you within 24 hours and offer you our best services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51s4DUeQMaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AILILIFE","source_asin":"B07GGGX85X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-387445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GGGX85X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GGGX85X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
