window.products.push({"id":387489,"name":"Return of the Prodigal Son by Rembrandt, 18x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KamSC5oTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped multi panel canvas art set features decorative tiles with Mayan designs. Most days, one would find Marion Rose putting on her favorite music or playing an old video before settling in to paint for the day in her spacious studio, especially once the winter chill set in. Her work is influenced by past masters such as Joaquin Sorolla, Tom Thomson, Carl Rungius, Bob Kuhn, and many others that work today in a variety of subjects and media. She also studied printmaking, life painting and drawing in college in her 30's. Her subjects come from her life of traveling enthusiastically as often as she could, both close to home or across the ocean. Sketching and studying animals were a favorite pastime, setting an excellent foundation for creating authentic work. Texture and richly colored paint applied generously by knife or brush strokes capture the essence of a subject's spirit and demeanor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KamSC5oTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B074CRGX24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-387489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074CRGX24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074CRGX24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":387490,"name":"Sunflower Laundry Bag Backpack with Strap Travel Dirty Clothes Organizer Backpack Hamper for Girls Apartment College Dorm Room Essentials","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71brsDanF9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As a professional manufacturer of laundry bags, we have been committed to designing beautiful and durable storage baskets for many years. This multifunctional foldable Sunflowers laundry bag is a practical helper for every family. It will not break like a plastic basket, nor will it take up too much space. Laundry bag specification: Material: 600D Oxford cloth Size:14.5 inch Dia * 29.3 inch H Why choose it? High capacity The fabric laundry bag has enough capacity to hold more items, keep the room tidy and decorate the house. The dirty clothes bag with drawstring can be knotted at the top for easy movement and will not scratch the floor and furniture. Durable storage basket The laundry bag is made of high-quality Oxford cloth, which is wear-resistant and durable. The storage basket can be folded for easy storage and carrying. Multifunctional storage bag Foldable storage bags can be used in every room, such as bedroom, living room, children's room, game room, apartment, university dormitory, etc. The storage basket can store clothes, socks, towels, blankets and sundries. Travel backpack The laundry bag has a handle and a back strap, the cross stitching makes it have an excellent load-bearing capacity. The large-capacity laundry bag can be used as a backpack and used in travel or camping. 100% satisfaction guarantee We are full of confidence in the quality of this dirty laundry bag and are willing to solve any related problems for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71brsDanF9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MCHIVER","source_asin":"B09FLNNKHY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-387490","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FLNNKHY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FLNNKHY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":387491,"name":"Sundown Interiors Thermal Insulated Blackout Curtains, Triple Woven Polyester with Rod Pocket / Back Tab Set of 2 Panels with Bonus Matching Tiebacks,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P1pybspmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made of premium triple-woven fabric, our Sundown Interiors Curtains block MORE light, noise, heat & cold than drapes that cost far more. Set includes 2 panels, each 52\" W x 63\" L, with bonus tie-backs. Do you toss & turn at night? Does it seem like hours before you finally fall asleep? Our Sundown Interiors Curtains Can Help These beautiful drapes block out all light, creating a calming atmosphere. Their blackout effect can actually help your body produce more melatonin, the natural sleep-inducing hormone. Result? You drift into restful sleep... and wake up relaxed & refreshed! The Secret? Superior \"3-Pass\" Fabric Unlike thin, chintzy drapes, these better-made curtains come in premium polyester, triple-woven & triple-coated for extra heft & opacity. Yet, for all their light-blocking power, they have NO stiff, heavy linings - so they always drape smoothly & gracefully. Our Sundown Interiors Curtains Also: Help block external sound, so there's less noise to distract & disturb you Insulate against heat & cold, for year-round comfort & energy savings Enhance your home decor, from bedroom to living room to kids' rooms Plus, You Get Bonus Tie-Backs (a $9.99 Value) Your room-darkening drapes arrive attractively packaged along with our exclusive FREE extra: a set of 2 matching tie-backs. All at one great value price! Order Now for a Better Night's Sleep! Plus, get extras for all the sleep-deprived folks on your gift list. Perfect for new moms and babies, night-shift workers, and all insomniacs!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P1pybspmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sundown Interiors","source_asin":"B01LVVAC0N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-387491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LVVAC0N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LVVAC0N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
