window.products.push({"id":387610,"name":"Classycoo Popsicle Molds 9 Pcs Popsicle Mould PP Ice Pop Molds BPA Free Popsicle Mold Easy Release Reusable Ice Popsicle Maker Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xFUJbuljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[100% Safe Material] Classycoo Popsicle mould is made of 100% BPA free PP material, safe and odorless for long-term use in your home. Our Popsicle molds are oversized to hold more treats but stand securely in a tray that fits your refrigerator. [Hollow-Carved Design] Our ice pop mold is design with hollow shank that perfectly match the plastic Popsicle sticks. When you use the reusable plastic sticks to make Popsicle, the juice won't overflow, and the Popsicle shape will be more perfect. [Say No to Sticky Hands] These ice pops have a drip tray at the base of each one to catch the drips, so your hands won't become sticky anymore! The slotted holes in the tray fix the stick in the Popsicle, and make it easy to remove the Popsicle from the mold. [Easy to Take Out] The Popsicle maker is easy to pull out--Just submerge the mould in warm water for 1-3 minutes, then you can easily pull your frozen treats out of the mould. [Multi-purpose] You can use the multifunctional mould to make Popsicle in different flavors by filling with juice, yogurt, ice cream, puree, apple sauce and more. This set has 9 pieces molds, so you can make 9 different flavors at a time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xFUJbuljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classycoo","source_asin":"B0B4FWVN2P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-387610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4FWVN2P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4FWVN2P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":387611,"name":"Smart Air Beds Inflatable Sofa Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Tnobvay7L._AC_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for more than \"just an air bed\", then the Smart Air Beds 5 x 1 Inflatable Sofa Bed is probably the right piece of inflatable furniture for you. Depending on the chambers you inflate and the configuration, the Smart Air Beds 5 x 1 Inflatable Sofa Bed can be: an air bed that measures 80\" x 60\" x 8\", perfect for two people as a short term sleeping solution; a raised air bed that measures 39\" x 60\" x 16\", great for a temporary bed for one; a relaxing lounger - from the air bed position, just inflate the back and arm rests; a sturdy recliner - take the lounger and flip it over so the arm/back rest is sitting on the ground; and of course, a spacious two person sofa (60\" wide with ~ 40\" of seating space) Five uses from one product - hence the name 5 x 1! The Smart Air Beds 5 x 1 Inflatable Sofa Bed is made of PVC vinyl which is easy to clean or repair should any kind of mishaps occur (comes with a patch kit). Also included absolutely FREE with your purchase are a detachable AC pump with three nozzles (made to plug in to US outlets - a $24 value) and a lightweight carry bag to take everything with you (a $4.99 value). If you want to take the Smart Air Beds 5 x 1 Inflatable Sofa Bed camping with you, all you will need is a rechargeable or battery powered pump (not included), and you are good to go! When you are finished using the product, deflation and storage is a snap. Simple release the air through the three quick release valves (most of the air will immediately evacuate), use the deflation port on the AC pump to suck out the remaining air, fold the sofa up, and store it in the carry bag. When it's all said and done, the item is no bigger than an average gym bag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Tnobvay7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smart Air Beds","source_asin":"B0013X9N06","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-387611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0013X9N06","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0013X9N06","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
